# Storefront buttons

For primary CTAs (links, submit, add-to-cart, checkout, auth):

- Use `SarjanButton`, `sarjanButtonClass()`, or `withBtnIcon()` from `@/lib/sarjan-button`
- Do **not** add new `tf-btn btn-fill` / `btn-white` / `btn-reset` combinations
- Style: white bg + black text; hover logo red `--sarjan-accent` (#8b1e2d) + white text
- See `docs/STOREFRONT-BUTTONS.md`
